{"about_the_game":"<strong>CIPHERCELL</strong> is a minimalist logic puzzle game where you slide cells together to perform arithmetic. The objective is to get the last cell to zero. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da893962.poster.avif?t=1641153093\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da893962.webm?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da893962.mp4?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Smaller numbers get added to larger numbers when slid in that order. Conversely, larger numbers subtract smaller numbers, and equal numbers cancel each other out.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/d970a38f9d9897d5a8fa6c73b756ef28.poster.avif?t=1641153093\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/d970a38f9d9897d5a8fa6c73b756ef28.webm?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/d970a38f9d9897d5a8fa6c73b756ef28.mp4?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy to learn, hard to Master:</strong> Order of events and number comparisons determine the outcome <br></li><li><strong>Hundreds of Levels </strong><br></li><li><strong>Multiple solutions to problems </strong><br></li><li><strong>Relaxing and soothing experience </strong></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1527650?t=1641153093","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1527650?t=1641153093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1641153093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1641153093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Add To Your Wishlist</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/6cb7830afa7eed9707be30dfa8223042.poster.avif?t=1641153093\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/6cb7830afa7eed9707be30dfa8223042.webm?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/6cb7830afa7eed9707be30dfa8223042.mp4?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>CIPHERCELL</strong> is a minimalist logic puzzle game where you slide cells together to perform arithmetic. The objective is to get the last cell to zero. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da893962.poster.avif?t=1641153093\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da893962.webm?t=1641153093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1527650/extras/59f54d94070439d42e75df23da